    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "# Is AI Native Growth and Engagement\n\nCampaign-focused Azure Workbook for the web app's Application Insights telemetry. It combines browser traffic from `AppPageViews` with custom engagement and conversion events from `AppEvents`.\n\nCurrent window: **{TimeRange:label}**  \nRepository drill-in: **{RepoFilter}**\n\nThis project does not emit generic clickstream telemetry yet. In this dashboard, **CTA clicks** are the tracked intent events you already send today, mainly scan requests and report-share requests. Repository filtering applies only to repo-attributed events, not anonymous page traffic."
      },
      "name": "text - intro"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "## Snapshot"
      },
      "name": "text - snapshot"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
